.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt PUB4-ADMIN 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pub4-admin
.Nd fixed-verb privileged broker for pub4 production operations
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar verb arguments ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the root-owned broker installed at
.Pa /usr/local/sbin/pub4-admin .
It exposes a bounded argv protocol for selected service, resource, application
layout, deployment and CI operations.
It does not evaluate shell command
strings and does not accept an arbitrary filesystem path as a command selector.
.Pp
The broker requires effective root privileges through the reviewed
.Xr doas 1
path.
The deploy script checks that the installed broker exists, is executable,
and is not a symbolic link before continuing.
.Pp
Unknown verbs, unapproved services, invalid argument shapes and paths outside
the explicit allowlist are refused.
The broker is an internal privilege
boundary, not a general-purpose shell.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
doas /usr/local/sbin/pub4-admin service check relayd
doas /usr/local/sbin/pub4-admin disk-usage /home
.Ed
.Sh SECURITY
Do not expand the verb set or replace fixed argv validation with shell
evaluation.
Update the calling contract and its regression tests when the
privileged interface changes.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr doas 1 ,
.Xr rcctl 8 ,
.Xr vps-deploy 8
